<section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ARCHON</p><h1>For books with a <em>clear point of view.</em></h1><p>We are an independent publishing house pairing traditional editorial values with contemporary clarity.</p></section><section class="section two-col"><article><h2>Our philosophy</h2><p>Archon exists for work that deserves patient attention. We believe a book is not merely a product: it is a considered meeting of language, design and reader.</p><p>From an early manuscript to a finished edition, we make the publishing process feel focused, generous and honest.</p></article><aside><p class="eyebrow">OUR VALUES</p><h3>Curiosity</h3><h3>Craft</h3><h3>Collaboration</h3><h3>Care</h3></aside></section><section class="section dark"><p class="eyebrow">OUR PROMISE</p><h2>To give every story the attention it asks for.</h2></section>
